msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Brakuje widoku Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong>.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p><p>Moduł instaluje trzy konfiguracje widoków, znajdujące się w /"
"config/install. Wszystkie muszą być zainstalowane, aby panel wyświetlał "
"wyniki.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p><p>Aby naprawić: skopiuj i wklej zawartość pliku <strong>/"
"editoria11y/config/install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> do importu "
"typu „Widok” pod adresem <a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/"
"single/import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. "
"Jeśli synchronizujesz konfigurację z systemem plików, upewnij się, że te "
"Widoki są w repozytorium.</p>"

